# .dockerignore for the commit-image build.
# Goal: bake in the FULL repo (including .git history — the grader uses it),
# dropping only local build artifacts and editor/OS cruft. Dev image, not minimal.
#
# microscheme's own Makefile/gitignore keep generated files at the repo root
# (see .gitignore: src/*_hex.c, the `microscheme` binary, examples/*.s|*.elf|*.hex, *.o) —
# mayhem/build.sh regenerates all of these fresh at build time, so a stray local build
# must not leak stale objects/binaries into the image.
src/*_hex.c
/microscheme
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
examples/*.s
examples/*.elf
examples/*.hex

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
